---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "混凝土加固用丝网：类型与规格";
const description = "焊接钢筋网片（WWR）及其混凝土应用指南。涵盖型号、尺寸、标准和采购注意事项。";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">混凝土加固用丝网</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-theme-muted max-w-2xl">
        焊接钢筋网片可控制混凝土开裂并增加抗拉强度。
        了解型号和规格有助于您订购合适的产品。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-theme-muted">
    <a href="/zh/" class="hover:text-theme-accent">首页</a> / 
    <span>应用领域</span> / 
    混凝土加固
  </nav>

  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <!-- Overview -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">混凝土中的丝网</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        混凝土抗压性能优异但抗拉性能差。丝网——特别是
        焊接钢筋网片（WWR）——提供抗拉强度以控制收缩
        开裂并改善结构性能。
      </p>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        主要应用：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>地坪</strong> — 仓库地面、停车场、工业地坪</li>
        <li><strong>预制构件</strong> — 墙板、化粪池、接线盒</li>
        <li><strong>喷射混凝土支护</strong> — 隧道衬砌、边坡加固</li>
        <li><strong>砌体墙</strong> — 砌块墙中的梯筋或桁架筋</li>
        <li><small>住宅车道和露台</small> — 轻型防裂</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- WWR Styles -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">焊接钢筋网片型号</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        WWR 以型号编号表示丝间距和直径：
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-theme-tertiary">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">型号</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">间距（英寸）</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">丝材规格</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">常见用途</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-theme">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">6×6-W1.4×W1.4</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">6 × 6</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">W1.4 (10 号)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">住宅、轻商业</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">6×6-W2.9×W2.9</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">6 × 6</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">W2.9 (6 号)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">商业地坪、车道</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">4×4-W4.0×W4.0</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">4 × 4</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">W4.0 (4 号)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">工业地坪、重载</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">2×2-W8.0×W8.0</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">2 × 2</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">W8.0 (2 号)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">预制构件、结构应用</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        注意：W 编号表示丝径的百分之一英寸。W2.9 = 0.029" 直径。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Sheet vs Roll -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">网片与卷网</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        WWR 有两种形式，各有不同的铺设和搬运特点：
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">网片（垫）</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">
            预切矩形片，通常 8' × 20' 或 8' × 15'。
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-theme-secondary space-y-1">
            <li>+ 铺设更快，搭接更少</li>
            <li>+ 平整，更容易定位到正确深度</li>
            <li>+ 大型矩形区域浪费更少</li>
            <li>− 运输成本更高（体积大）</li>
            <li>− 需要吊车或叉车搬运</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">卷网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">
            像围栏一样卷起的连续网，通常宽 5' 或 7.5' × 长 150-200'。
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-theme-secondary space-y-1">
            <li>+ 同等面积成本更低</li>
            <li>+ 人工搬运方便（无需设备）</li>
            <li>+ 运输效率高</li>
            <li>− 有弹性，难以摊平</li>
            <li>− 需要更多搭接</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Standards -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">标准与规范</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        结构用 WWR 必须符合相关标准：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>ASTM A185</strong> — 混凝土用焊接钢丝网（旧标准，现为 A1064）</li>
        <li><strong>ASTM A1064/A1064M</strong> — 碳钢 WWR 现行标准</li>
        <li><strong>ASTM A497</strong> — 焊接带肋钢筋网（更高强度）</li>
        <li><strong>CRSI 标准实践手册</strong> — 行业铺设和细部指南</li>
        <li><strong>当地建筑规范</strong> — 可能规定最低配筋要求</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        采购 WWR 时，请索取钢厂质保书以确认：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li>钢材牌号（丝材通常 ASTM A510）</li>
        <li>屈服强度（常见 60 ksi 或 80 ksi）</li>
        <li>焊点抗剪强度</li>
        <li>如镀锌，镀层重量</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Sourcing Considerations -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">WWR 采购：关键注意事项</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">屈服强度验证</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            并非所有 WWR 都达到 60 ksi 屈服强度。市场上存在
            用于非结构用途的低强度产品。请在质保书上核实屈服强度。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">焊接质量</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            焊点必须达到丝的抗拉强度。劣质焊点在搬运
            时断裂，或在使用中形成薄弱点。请索取焊点抗剪测试数据。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">尺寸公差</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            ASTM A1064 允许间距 ±1/2"、丝径 ±0.004"。
            自动化铺设系统可能需要更严的公差。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">防腐保护</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            标准 WWR 为光面黑钢。腐蚀环境中
            请指定镀锌（ASTM A641）或环氧涂层（ASTM A884）钢筋网。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Weight Calculator -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">计算 WWR 重量</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        使用我们的<a href="/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">焊接丝网重量计算器</a>计算
        项目的材料重量。这有助于核对报价和规划物流。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Related Pages -->
    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">继续探索</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">焊接丝网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">通用焊接网规格</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">焊接网计算器</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">按配筋规格计算重量</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/spec-tables/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">规格对照表</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">丝规与尺寸数据</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/sourcing-guide/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">采购指南</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">建筑网材的采购流程</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">需要焊接钢筋网片？</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-muted mb-4">发送您的项目规格，我们将为您对接合格的制造商。</p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block accent-bg hover:accent-bg text-theme-primary font-semibold px-6 py-2 rounded transition">
        提交询盘
      </a>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
